=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  play config --------------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Play mode: hardn's Configuration screen (pkg/screens/config),$
# proposed with no Figma frame, on a hardn.yml loaded by the$
# real loader (pkg/config). It only shows: no plan, no y/N, no$
# journal, no host read. Nothing on this machine changes or is$
# read.$
$
# Configuration files ##########################################$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Search path          A typical file$
   2) -f                   The same file, by -f$
   3) HARDN_CONFIG         The same file, by HARDN_CONFIG$
   4) No file              Every key a default$
   5) Minimal              A two-line file$
   6) Not used             Keys nothing reads$
   7) Missing              HARDN_CONFIG's file is not there$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0-7 or q]: 4$
$
# Info: config/none$
# No file anywhere: every key at its default.$
$
# Configuration ################################################$
$
  File ---------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Path                 None found$
   -  hardn is using its defaults.$
$
  Users --------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  username             Not set (default)$
   -  adminNoPassword      false (default)$
   -  sshKeys              None (default)$
$
  SSH ----------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  sshPort              22 (default)$
   -  disableRootSSH       false (default)$
   -  sshConfigFile$
      /etc/ssh/sshd_config.d/hardn.conf (default)$
$
  Firewall -----------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  enableUfwSshPolicy   false (default)$
   -  ufwAppProfiles       None (default)$
   -  ufwTrustedInterfaces None (default)$
$
  DNS ----------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  configureDns         false (default)$
   -  nameservers          None (default)$
$
  Auto Updates -------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  enableUnattendedUpgrades$
      false (default)$
$
  Backup -------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  enableBackups        true (default)$
   -  backupPath           /var/backups/hardn (default)$
$
  General ------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  dryRun               false (default)$
   -  confirmTimeout       3m (default)$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0 or q]: 0$
$
# Configuration files ##########################################$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Search path          A typical file$
   2) -f                   The same file, by -f$
   3) HARDN_CONFIG         The same file, by HARDN_CONFIG$
   4) No file              Every key a default$
   5) Minimal              A two-line file$
   6) Not used             Keys nothing reads$
   7) Missing              HARDN_CONFIG's file is not there$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0-7 or q]: 0$
$
  simulated system ---------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Nothing was applied.$
$

